
---

### ✅ **.gitignore**

Add a `.gitignore` to exclude unnecessary files:

```gitignore
# .NET build artifacts
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# VS Code settings
.vscode/

# Rider settings
.idea/

# User-specific files
*.swp
*.log
*.tmp

# OS-specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# EF Core migrations folders (optional)
# Migrations/

# Secrets
appsettings.Development.json
secrets.json

# Others
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
